WEBVTT

00:01:48.366 --> 00:01:50.666
Once the soldier of light had
finally attained his power,

00:01:50.700 --> 00:01:54.700
he was stunned by
its incredible force and trembled.

00:01:55.866 --> 00:01:58.096
It's the fate of the one
who possesses powerâ€”

00:01:58.133 --> 00:02:01.403
the power to hold the entire world
in his grasp.

00:02:02.700 --> 00:02:06.530
However, the warrior was
unaware at this time...

00:02:07.500 --> 00:02:11.600
Unaware that the power could swallow
him whole if he chooses the wrong path.

00:02:11.866 --> 00:02:18.866
Unaware that it has the potential to
harm everyone and destroy him as well.

00:02:20.200 --> 00:02:25.630
And unaware that he is not the only one
who possessed this same power.

00:02:29.433 --> 00:02:33.703
Shu's party has come to the town
attacked by the Grankingdom.

00:02:34.366 --> 00:02:35.866
There, they meet Marumaro,

00:02:35.900 --> 00:02:38.570
a member of the Devee Tribe who
also is a Shadow Wielder.

00:02:40.233 --> 00:02:43.973
A misunderstanding causes
them to clash,

00:02:44.000 --> 00:02:49.630
but this misunderstanding is resolved during
the battle against the Grankingdom army.

00:02:50.900 --> 00:02:56.500
Shu and the others team up and attempt
to rescue the captured townspeople,

00:02:56.533 --> 00:02:59.233
but their plans are thwarted by

00:02:59.266 --> 00:03:04.996
the two Grankingdom Shadow Wielders,
Ivanov and Gustov.

00:03:10.433 --> 00:03:15.403
GENERAL LOGI

00:03:50.000 --> 00:03:51.030
Let's go!

00:03:51.366 --> 00:03:53.326
We're defenders of justice, maro!

00:03:53.566 --> 00:03:55.566
We'll take the bad guys down, maro!

00:03:56.066 --> 00:03:58.126
Why are we attacking now?

00:03:58.533 --> 00:04:01.633
I thought we were supposed to
avoid meaningless battles.

00:04:02.466 --> 00:04:03.826
The answer's simple.

00:04:04.166 --> 00:04:06.496
It's because this isn't
a meaningless battle.

00:04:07.100 --> 00:04:11.100
The Grankingdom ship is probably
heading towards Fort Gorky.

00:04:12.200 --> 00:04:14.670
You heard the two Shadow
Wielders' conversation, didn't you?

00:04:15.400 --> 00:04:16.070
Conversation?

00:04:16.400 --> 00:04:18.230
Our mission is over.

00:04:18.866 --> 00:04:22.896
Now what should we do until we
report to General Logi at two o'clock?

00:04:24.266 --> 00:04:26.926
It's not wise to make
General Logi angry.

00:04:27.633 --> 00:04:30.633
Besides, we can beat
these guys anytime.

00:04:32.633 --> 00:04:35.833
General Logi...
Leader of the expedition forces.

00:04:35.866 --> 00:04:38.466
The stories of his battle prowess
are legendary.

00:04:38.733 --> 00:04:41.033
That Grankingdom's general, huh?

00:04:41.266 --> 00:04:45.496
I hear Logi's work in the Battle of Igrashido
was just like that of an avatar.

00:04:46.133 --> 00:04:49.103
He turned the Grankingdom army
around all by himself

00:04:49.133 --> 00:04:51.403
just before they were
about to be defeated

00:04:51.433 --> 00:04:55.203
and annihilated nearly all of
the enemy's main forces.

00:04:56.533 --> 00:04:58.403
If you're going to aim,
go for the head.

00:04:58.833 --> 00:05:02.733
Normally, you'd think our force is
not strong enough to bring down Gorky.

00:05:03.266 --> 00:05:06.596
I'm sure the enemy won't think
that we'd attack.

00:05:07.966 --> 00:05:11.496
And they have an uncertain factor
on their hand called prisoners.

00:05:12.566 --> 00:05:13.696
Now it makes sense.

00:05:14.100 --> 00:05:15.870
General Logi...

00:05:28.233 --> 00:05:30.303
The invasion of Calca Town
is complete.

00:05:30.933 --> 00:05:34.703
And we've also just completed the transfer
of 126 prisoners to this fortress.

00:05:35.200 --> 00:05:39.070
We took a surprise attack by
a group of Shadow Wielders,

00:05:39.100 --> 00:05:40.370
but succeeded in warding them off.

00:05:40.833 --> 00:05:43.873
We completed all of the missions
without incident.

00:05:44.433 --> 00:05:46.533
This concludes our report.

00:05:46.933 --> 00:05:48.003
That's concerning...

00:05:48.933 --> 00:05:50.003
What do you mean?

00:05:50.400 --> 00:05:52.570
Those Shadow Wielders...

00:05:53.800 --> 00:05:57.230
We were able to manage them
on our own, so...

00:05:57.766 --> 00:06:00.996
I don't believe there is any need
for you to be concerned.

00:06:01.400 --> 00:06:04.400
However, you guys weren't able
to finish them off.

00:06:05.100 --> 00:06:05.770
Well...

00:06:06.066 --> 00:06:09.196
I'd like to hear about them.

00:06:09.833 --> 00:06:13.303
The total number of enemies who
appeared before us was five.

00:06:13.733 --> 00:06:15.673
Four of them were Shadow Wielders.

00:06:16.200 --> 00:06:21.870
The leader of the unit was a woman
in her early twenties with silver hair.

00:06:22.266 --> 00:06:25.266
There were also two boys and
a child from the Devee Tribe.

00:06:26.000 --> 00:06:28.300
A silver-haired woman...

00:06:29.000 --> 00:06:30.270
Any other distinguishing
characteristics?

00:06:30.700 --> 00:06:33.570
As I recall, she had
on a skull bandana.

00:06:34.166 --> 00:06:35.826
Her Shadow type was a killer bat.

00:06:36.500 --> 00:06:38.870
She also had some skill with a sword.

00:06:40.300 --> 00:06:42.670
It must be Zola.

00:06:43.333 --> 00:06:46.073
Put the soldiers at Fort Gorky
on alert.

00:06:46.633 --> 00:06:48.273
Tell them to prepare for
an invasion.

00:06:48.833 --> 00:06:49.503
- Huh?
- Huh?

00:06:49.733 --> 00:06:52.803
Ivanov, Gustov... You two take
the lead on the defenses.

00:06:53.133 --> 00:06:55.003
Secure the interior of the fortress.

00:06:55.466 --> 00:06:56.466
Oh, but...

00:06:56.500 --> 00:06:59.400
They'll be here within
twenty-four hours.

00:06:59.633 --> 00:07:00.703
No way.

00:07:01.633 --> 00:07:03.633
We could bet on it if you like.

00:07:03.666 --> 00:07:06.796
No, I have no objection
to your opinion.

00:07:07.500 --> 00:07:08.700
Then, I'm counting on you.

00:07:09.300 --> 00:07:12.100
We have to prepare for reception.

00:07:16.133 --> 00:07:17.333
General Logi.

00:07:17.600 --> 00:07:19.970
Conveying a message from
Lord Nene.

00:07:21.066 --> 00:07:24.126
Unfortunately, it doesn't look like
we have the time to relax.

00:07:27.566 --> 00:07:30.396
Wow, it's huge!

00:07:31.166 --> 00:07:31.826
Oh!

00:07:31.866 --> 00:07:34.726
Let me see too, maro!

00:07:35.766 --> 00:07:37.966
How do you plan on bringing down
something like this?

00:07:38.400 --> 00:07:39.630
We'll wait for night.

00:07:39.966 --> 00:07:43.996
Learn the general topography
and the building layout by then.

00:07:56.900 --> 00:07:59.130
How are we gonna get over
something like this?

00:07:59.466 --> 00:08:00.666
You don't know?

00:08:01.233 --> 00:08:02.373
You do it like this.

00:08:07.900 --> 00:08:08.570
Shadow...

00:08:16.466 --> 00:08:17.126
Let's go.

00:08:25.866 --> 00:08:26.526
This way.

00:08:26.900 --> 00:08:27.570
Maro...

00:08:53.700 --> 00:08:54.730
Maro...

00:08:54.766 --> 00:08:55.426
Who's there?

00:09:11.700 --> 00:09:13.570
We've come to save you, maro!

00:09:13.833 --> 00:09:15.273
Run! Quick, maro!

00:09:20.200 --> 00:09:20.870
This way!

00:09:23.500 --> 00:09:24.770
The exit's that way, maro!

00:09:24.833 --> 00:09:25.833
Hurry, maro!

00:09:26.333 --> 00:09:28.733
Stage one is complete!
Now all that's left...

00:09:30.600 --> 00:09:31.730
...is to tear this place apart!

00:09:49.300 --> 00:09:50.300
It's the exit!

00:09:50.333 --> 00:09:51.573
Let's go, maro!

00:09:58.166 --> 00:09:59.226
That's far enough.

00:09:59.633 --> 00:10:03.533
Don't get too carried away,
you ignorant fools.

00:10:32.500 --> 00:10:34.300
Choose...death!

00:10:34.500 --> 00:10:35.570
Or compliance!

00:10:40.433 --> 00:10:41.573
Choose, you say?

00:10:42.700 --> 00:10:43.970
Then, let's choose.

00:10:45.433 --> 00:10:48.773
My choice is your death!

00:10:49.200 --> 00:10:50.230
So you've appeared, huh?

00:10:50.300 --> 00:10:53.430
Then as you desire...
we'll give you death!

00:11:25.800 --> 00:11:26.800
There!

00:11:37.100 --> 00:11:37.770
Maro!

00:11:41.800 --> 00:11:43.270
I knew he wouldn't come out.

00:11:52.666 --> 00:11:55.866
Where is he?
He hasn't come out yet.

00:11:57.000 --> 00:11:59.130
Or did I miscalculate?

00:12:00.066 --> 00:12:02.066
Long time no see, Zola.

00:12:03.333 --> 00:12:04.333
Logi!

00:12:08.133 --> 00:12:09.803
Is that General Logi?

00:12:09.966 --> 00:12:11.466
Do those two know each other?

00:12:11.566 --> 00:12:12.226
Logi...

00:12:12.600 --> 00:12:14.170
Zola, just as I thought.

00:12:14.366 --> 00:12:17.166
No wonder this wound is
causing me such discomfort.

00:12:42.366 --> 00:12:44.766
You've gotten quite impetuous.

00:12:44.800 --> 00:12:46.670
You've got a Shadow!

00:12:47.200 --> 00:12:48.900
A lot happened after that.

00:12:49.333 --> 00:12:52.003
Wouldn't it be fun to chat
for a while?

00:12:52.600 --> 00:12:54.830
I don't have anything to
talk about with you!

00:12:55.166 --> 00:12:56.166
I see...

00:12:56.500 --> 00:12:59.900
Then let's settle what
wasn't settled then.

00:13:03.000 --> 00:13:04.630
My name is Valkyrie.

00:13:05.133 --> 00:13:10.433
I serve my master General Logi.
I am his sword and shield.

00:13:11.266 --> 00:13:11.926
General Logi.

00:13:12.300 --> 00:13:13.400
Leave this to us.

00:13:14.000 --> 00:13:15.770
Sorry, but I'm in a hurry, you see.

00:13:16.066 --> 00:13:17.326
I'm a blade.

00:13:17.833 --> 00:13:21.473
I shall slice up all that stands
in the way of my master!

00:13:22.766 --> 00:13:23.426
Now then...

00:13:29.866 --> 00:13:33.026
Defeating me is beyond your power
if that is all you have.

00:13:35.433 --> 00:13:36.933
Your defense is weak.

00:13:53.233 --> 00:13:55.103
You've lost your touch, Zola.

00:13:55.500 --> 00:13:58.530
Or maybe I've gotten too strong.

00:13:59.033 --> 00:14:02.733
Unfortunately, it seems crossing swords
with you any further would be useless.

00:14:03.066 --> 00:14:04.066
Shut up!

00:14:04.666 --> 00:14:07.126
Hornet Assassin!

00:14:14.233 --> 00:14:15.233
Wow!

00:14:15.500 --> 00:14:17.000
That's Zola's special technique.

00:14:17.500 --> 00:14:19.330
No one's been able to stand up
to that attack.

00:14:24.933 --> 00:14:27.233
I've discerned all of your techniques.

00:14:27.600 --> 00:14:30.230
Like I said, you're not worth
fighting anymore.

00:14:31.233 --> 00:14:34.633
Of course, I wouldn't expect you
to give up so easily.

00:14:35.200 --> 00:14:37.430
Accept my compensation.

00:14:43.833 --> 00:14:45.673
Rose in May!

00:14:50.066 --> 00:14:51.066
Zola!

00:15:11.100 --> 00:15:13.300
Damn it! I'll do this!

00:15:13.566 --> 00:15:14.226
Me too!

00:15:17.666 --> 00:15:19.166
Waves of Rage!

00:15:22.133 --> 00:15:24.103
Blitz Claw!

00:15:40.733 --> 00:15:42.333
Jiro! Marumaro!

00:15:43.466 --> 00:15:44.466
I didn't see it coming.

00:15:45.833 --> 00:15:47.333
Too fast...maro...

00:16:27.133 --> 00:16:31.973
I'm scared.
M-My legs won't move.

00:16:40.233 --> 00:16:41.703
Ivanov, Gustov.

00:16:43.066 --> 00:16:44.196
I leave the rest to you guys.

00:16:44.700 --> 00:16:47.170
I'm being summoned
by Lord Nene.

00:16:47.366 --> 00:16:48.026
- Yes sir.
- Yes sir.

00:17:11.233 --> 00:17:13.973
Releasing the prisoners and
taking advantage of the confusion

00:17:14.000 --> 00:17:15.170
to bring down the fortress.

00:17:15.566 --> 00:17:17.996
That was a pretty good strategy, but...

00:17:23.733 --> 00:17:26.303
You all sealed your fate when
you attacked here,

00:17:26.333 --> 00:17:29.773
even though you knew that General Logi,
my brother, and I were here.

00:17:32.133 --> 00:17:33.273
Give me a break!

00:17:35.400 --> 00:17:37.430
We haven't failed yet!

00:17:49.000 --> 00:17:50.100
Stop!

00:17:59.000 --> 00:18:00.100
Kluke!

00:18:00.133 --> 00:18:01.733
No!

00:18:26.200 --> 00:18:28.170
What's so funny, Blue Dragon?!

00:18:28.933 --> 00:18:30.203
Help us out!

00:18:30.533 --> 00:18:31.973
Everyone's in trouble!

00:18:32.066 --> 00:18:35.166
Why should I have to help you?

00:18:35.266 --> 00:18:35.926
Huh?

00:18:36.566 --> 00:18:38.126
Cooperation is weakness.

00:18:38.433 --> 00:18:40.003
Power is everything!

00:18:40.133 --> 00:18:43.333
You don't have the power
to force me!

00:18:43.366 --> 00:18:44.366
What?!

00:18:44.400 --> 00:18:46.100
Lament over your powerlessness.

00:18:46.366 --> 00:18:51.296
I'll swallow you up into the darkness
after your soul has lost its light.

00:18:51.800 --> 00:18:56.030
That is the time for
the Blue Dragon's true resurrection.

00:19:00.833 --> 00:19:02.373
How pathetic.

00:19:03.033 --> 00:19:08.803
If you're upset, then why don't you
try submitting me by force?

00:19:12.533 --> 00:19:16.303
Fine. I'll show you my power!

00:19:19.733 --> 00:19:21.933
See for yourself!

00:19:22.766 --> 00:19:25.466
See whether I'm powerless or not!

00:19:26.066 --> 00:19:26.726
You!

00:19:26.966 --> 00:19:30.296
I've got someone
I wanna protect!

00:19:39.033 --> 00:19:40.303
Interesting!

00:19:55.300 --> 00:19:56.300
Shu...

00:20:10.266 --> 00:20:13.326
That's right. There was one more.

00:20:13.366 --> 00:20:16.496
But he couldn't use
his Shadow much.

00:20:16.533 --> 00:20:19.333
Wait, something's wrong!

00:20:28.133 --> 00:20:30.473
Here I go, Blue Dragon!

00:20:30.933 --> 00:20:34.603
Show me your power, Shu!

00:20:55.433 --> 00:20:58.733
What's with him?
He's so different from before!

00:20:58.966 --> 00:21:00.596
Attack! Defeat him!

00:21:02.233 --> 00:21:05.333
Eat this!
Our greatest technique!

00:21:05.466 --> 00:21:08.126
This attack will destroy everything!

00:21:10.533 --> 00:21:13.303
Soul Matter!

00:21:18.400 --> 00:21:19.070
- Shu!
- Shu!

00:21:49.766 --> 00:21:50.766
Did he do it?

00:21:50.800 --> 00:21:52.030
Wow, maro...

00:21:53.666 --> 00:21:54.326
Shu...

00:21:59.966 --> 00:22:00.696
Shu!

00:22:18.400 --> 00:22:21.800
Bye, girls. See ya! Bye-bye!

00:22:23.333 --> 00:22:27.403
You certainly did a fine job
in that battle, young ones.

00:22:28.600 --> 00:22:29.600
Who are you?

00:22:29.633 --> 00:22:31.233
My name is Legalas.

00:22:31.700 --> 00:22:34.830
I'm the regional inspector
of the Jibral Royal Army.

00:22:35.133 --> 00:22:38.673
After seeing how well you've fought,
I'm going to give you a mission!

00:22:39.600 --> 00:22:40.600
A mission?

00:22:41.433 --> 00:22:46.303
You'll take me back
to Jibral Castle. Safely!

00:24:21.866 --> 00:24:26.566
A triangle forms with Shu in the middle
when beautiful Bouquet joins the group.

00:24:26.600 --> 00:24:30.670
You two! I know I'm cool
but don't fight over me!

00:24:30.700 --> 00:24:32.270
What are you grinning about?

00:24:32.300 --> 00:24:34.030
Which one are you gonna pick,
me or this one?!

00:24:34.066 --> 00:24:36.626
Yeah! Me or Kluke! Which is it?

00:24:36.666 --> 00:24:37.326
Hey...

00:24:37.366 --> 00:24:40.166
FNext on Blue Dragon:
"Fluffy Fluffy Squeezy."
